HB0139 Interstate export of Wyoming horseracing.
Sponsored By: Joint Appropriations Committee
AN ACT relating to pari-mutuel wagering; authorizing agreements for purposes of
exporting Wyoming thoroughbred horseracing simulcast signals out-of-state;
specifying a fee; and providing for an effective date.
